    {
     "_key": "000000000001",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "03yxah6j48xw",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "c83qfv3fg5rc"
       ],
       "text": "Abu Simbel"
      },
      {
       "_key": "dvp6twh1mv14",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " historical overview"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "c83qfv3fg5rc",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-56813",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000009",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000002",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Abu Simbel History Uncovered: a portal to the past, this monumental site echoes the grandeur of ancient Egypt. Situated on the western bank of Lake Nasser, the twin temples of Abu Simbel stand as enduring testaments to the legacy of Pharaoh Ramesses II and the divine Queen Nefertari. "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000003"
       ],
       "text": "Unveil the mysteries"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000005",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " of their construction, the awe-inspiring relocation efforts, and the intricate carvings that narrate tales of gods and pharaohs. Journey with us as we delve into the "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000007",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000006"
       ],
       "text": "heart"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000008",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " of this archaeological marvel, revealing stories etched in stone over three millennia age."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000003",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/siwa-oasis-travel-guide/unveiled-mysteries/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/guide/siwa-oasis",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000006",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
