    {
     "_key": "00000000003c",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000003b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "El traslado monumental"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000003d",
     "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/ramses-statues-abu-simble-min.jpg",
     "_type": "image",
     "alt": [
      {
       "_key": "en",
       "value": "Upward view of the towering Ramses II statues at Abu Simbel."
      }
     ],
     "caption": [
      {
       "_key": "en",
       "value": "La imponente herencia de Ramsés II en Abu Simbel, vista desde abajo."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000051",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000003e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "La "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000040",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000003f"
       ],
       "text": "construcción de la Gran Presa de Asuán"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000041",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " a mediados del siglo XX supuso una amenaza existencial para los templos de Abu Simbel."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000042",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000043",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Sumergidas bajo las aguas del "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000045",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000044"
       ],
       "text": "lago Nasser"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000046",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", estas antiguas maravillas se enfrentaban al olvido."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000047",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000048",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Esta terrible circunstancia llevó a "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000049"
       ],
       "text": "la UNESCO,"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " en 1960, a hacer un llamamiento mundial para salvar los monumentos nubios, incluido Abu Simbel."
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Se produjo "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000004e"
       ],
       "text": "una colaboración internacional en la que"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000050",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " participaron más de 50 naciones, entre ellas Estados Unidos, Holanda, Gran Bretaña, España y muchas otras, junto con el gobierno egipcio y la UNESCO."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000003f",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
